BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T000000
DTSTAMP:20260508T234758
CREATED:20260128T122650Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260507T004548Z
UID:10041984-1778274000-1778284800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Strictly Liquid
DESCRIPTION:May 8 9:00 pm – 12:00 am | $10 cover | Event Details  \nStrictly Liquid\, a rising rock and roll jam band from Florida and now based in Asheville\, is captivating audiences with their original music that embodies the spirit of exploration. Drawing inspiration from iconic artists like Phish\, Grateful Dead\, The Allman Brothers\, The Beatles\, and Pink Floyd\, their sound is a dynamic fusion of psychedelic rock\, blues\, jazz\, funk\, and a touch of Americana. From the touching melodies of “Halfway” to the cascading peaks of “Crow\,” their music takes listeners on a journey through the broad spectrum of human emotion. Each performance is a unique experience\, with the band forging a deep connection with their audience every time they take the stage. \n  \nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/strictly-liquid-album-release-party/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/668733475_1537547758380101_7166908374027626015_n-e1778114738189.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
